{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_3_30001_01_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:e398adf12581c9f63fddc6e6f679290fad998927871bdc2b7c153d679ebb7172",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:22cec4d7e99dd1bfb933dae7aa190e15cad947290662d0b26b1c29006097a657",
      "text": "让笑容之花绽放",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fcc4c22b1a3ac93b23fc37702cc9b89cad9b8110c6d0e7ce3f9695fc23ddf702",
      "text": "受邀在朋友的结婚喜宴上\n担任友人代表致辞的实。\n作为祝贺，他与皮埃尔和恭二三人决定\n登台演唱《想いはETERNITY》。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_a:cmd-000019:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6bd711a0c587f0c078d13f61396e0634340adf4afbcabad0ac20aea8f2b2a191",
      "text": "序幕",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_a:cmd-000019:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:22cec4d7e99dd1bfb933dae7aa190e15cad947290662d0b26b1c29006097a657",
      "text": "让笑容之花绽放",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_a:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b468df955f12a4b9854940456b4ca69fb092e1faca73c57a3f4910ba8348bfe8",
      "text": "……当时，依然年幼懵懂的我们，\n除了彼此这些伙伴，根本没有能互相理解的人。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_a:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:874a8ebb0fb18dfbe002a08e903797192a64bf3073ed57c41b7c726638b9c520",
      "text": "但是，正因为有了伙伴的陪伴，无论是快乐还是痛苦，\n我们都能拼尽全力跨越过去。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_a:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8b67653c4f58154491414f1a2f15ade5dbc6526cb288f36576c6aa84fad5e9b5",
      "text": "我们明白，\n幸福是无法独自一人创造的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_a:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d03b641eb5f411b53a8c3a3cf35cb51d215e166954bcdda2aac3321b9804cfc5",
      "text": "今后也请两个人携手并进，\n一同创造幸福，分享幸福。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_a:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:14955ac7cd8d038595123653604f08ba2c6824bf1c8b9e424bd8db16b22586a2",
      "text": "祝愿二位拥有满溢着笑容的未来……\n这是我们送上的通行护照，请收下吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_a:cmd-000082:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b96ceb6b2d1fcbcdabe6c03fcf2f5a5866bde4f4f92f496740b23ea46d58dd14",
      "text": "辛苦了，实先生！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_a:cmd-000087:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8e6fb10e81b80d1263574091c75dd264de28c671707f16a4264bddcc40f29ce1",
      "text": "啊哈哈……因为是第一次在朋友面前做偶像，\n稍微有点紧张呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_a:cmd-000091:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1d10ec5296ac2b48597c8e47b7782250b3021c9ec1a19125caa2faa630f79aa6",
      "text": "我的心意，不知是否好好传达给那家伙了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_a:cmd-000095:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1f57e0a547c7bebac357397dda1b1911453403f642854cc4bd094a4160873b7e",
      "text": "实先生的心意一定传达到了。\n是非常棒的致辞和舞台表演！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_a:cmd-000099:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:90cd2f45086f4b6102f821584ca740d345204651f9ef5b2998c885a1b693c775",
      "text": "谢谢你，●●●●プロデューサー……\n今天能在这里表演，真的太好了。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
